 * - Confirm that a duplicate mapping attempt (same product and channel) fails as expected
 * - Confirm mapping rejects non-existent channel (invalid channel_id)
 * - Confirm mapping rejects non-existent product (invalid product_id)
 * - Audit log verification is intentionally skipped due to lack of exposed API for logs
