 * - Returns a valid result structure with an empty data array
 * - Provides correct, self-consistent pagination metadata
 * - Does not yield error responses or status codes (i.e., the search is treated as a valid, empty result)
 *
 * Business context:
 * The test simulates realistic seller onboarding (no pre-existing orders), authenticating via registration, then invoking the order search endpoint with edge-case filters:
 *  - e.g., total_amount_gte set to an extremely high value never present in real orders, and/or date range set into the future.
