 * 2. Register customer (receives notification).
 * 3. As customer, favorite a product.
 * 4. As customer, create a favorite notification.
 * 5. As customer, delete the favorite notification (simulate soft-deletion).
 * 6. As admin, attempt to update the deleted notification record (should fail/throw).
 *
 * Validates that logical deletion is enforced and data integrity remains per compliance policies, even with admin privileges. Uses real API only.
